 "remarks": "Perfect for the Holidays! 3+ acre estate in the heart of North Stamford! This mid-century modern home boasts 4-5 bedrooms 3 full baths and 1 half. Terrific open space both inside and out provides a flexible floor plan that allows for endless possibilities and potential. Plenty of windows and skylights that cascade natural light over the brand new hardwood floors. A gracious front entry. Foyer connects to Living Room, Dining Room, Kitchen, and the large and ample family room with a fire place and wet bar, step outside to the outdoor terraces and decks with and exterior landscape has beautiful gardens and fire pit The finish lower level has a second family room with a second fireplace and a second wet bar. a bedroom or exercise room with a sauna, full bath as well as the laundry room. Possible in-law suite There is parking galore with attached garage and 2 car with even more parking space in the oversized driveway. Central air, Fuel efficient hybrid water tank.Whether you are working/runing a business from home, love to entertain, or just need a peaceful and private family estate, this home will not disappoint you. There is room for improvement and potential in value.",
